      "Language": "jpn",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Eleven patients with lumbago due to renal ptosis, and 23 patients with stress incontinence were treated with Tsumura Hotyuekkito (Buzhongyiqitang), an old Chinese prescription, 7.5 g, three times a day. The subjective symptoms were improved in 9 cases (82%) of lumbago and 18 cases (78%) of stress incontinence. No side effects were observed."},
